<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>开单运营方案 1.0 美化原型</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7fafc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-2: #f1f5f9;
      --teal: #0f766e;
      --teal-dark: #115e59;
      --teal-soft: #ccfbf1;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --blue-soft: #dbeafe;
      --amber: #f59e0b;
      --amber-soft: #fef3c7;
      --red: #dc2626;
      --red-soft: #fee2e2;
      --green: #16a34a;
      --green-soft: #dcfce7;
      --text: #111827;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --line: #e5e7eb;
      --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --radius: 8px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px;
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: stretch;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero-main {
      padding: 32px;
      min-height: 360px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .hero-tags,
    .tag-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .tag.teal {
      background: var(--teal-soft);
      color: var(--teal-dark);
    }

    .tag.blue {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .tag.amber {
      background: var(--amber-soft);
      color: #92400e;
    }

    .tag.green {
      background: var(--green-soft);
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .hero-side {
      padding: 22px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      align-content: stretch;
    }

    .metric-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      min-height: 140px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .metric-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .metric-value {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .metric-note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .section-desc {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 620px;
    }

    .model-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .logic-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .logic-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .logic-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logic-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .number {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--teal-dark);
      background: var(--teal-soft);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .logic-item strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .logic-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .flow-node {
      min-height: 108px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      position: relative;
    }

    .flow-node::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -12px;
      top: 50%;
      width: 12px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
    }

    .flow-node:nth-child(4n)::after,
    .flow-node:last-child::after {
      display: none;
    }

    .flow-node h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .flow-node p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .phone-board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .phone-board.ops {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    }

    .phone {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 330px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #0f172a;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.16);
    }

    .screen {
      min-height: 620px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .status {
      height: 28px;
      padding: 8px 16px 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .phone-head {
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .phone-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .phone-body {
      padding: 14px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .mini-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .mini-card h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .form-row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .input {
      height: 38px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #fbfdff;
      padding: 0 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .upload-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .upload {
      height: 54px;
      border: 1px dashed #94a3b8;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .check-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .box {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .button-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .btn {
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .btn.primary {
      border-color: var(--teal);
      background: var(--teal);
      color: var(--surface);
    }

    .hero-card-mobile {
      background: var(--teal);
      color: var(--surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .hero-card-mobile .small {
      opacity: 0.78;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .money {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .stat {
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .stat b {
      display: block;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .stat span {
      opacity: 0.78;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .todo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .todo strong,
    .list-item strong {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .todo span,
    .list-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 24px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pill.teal {
      background: var(--teal-soft);
      color: var(--teal-dark);
    }

    .pill.blue {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .pill.amber {
      background: var(--amber-soft);
      color: #92400e;
    }

    .pill.green {
      background: var(--green-soft);
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .pill.red {
      background: var(--red-soft);
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .list-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .list-item:first-child {
      border-top: 0;
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .filter {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .filter span {
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .ai-box {
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px;
      color: #1e3a8a;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .signature {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .money-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .money-tile {
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .money-tile span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .money-tile b {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ops-hero {
      background: var(--blue);
    }

    .desktop-board {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .desktop {
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .desktop-bar {
      height: 46px;
      background: #111827;
      color: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .desktop-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
      min-height: 640px;
    }

    .side {
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .side-title {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .nav-item {
      height: 38px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .nav-item.active {
      background: var(--teal-soft);
      color: var(--teal-dark);
    }

    .admin-main {
      padding: 20px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      align-content: start;
    }

    .admin-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .admin-head h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .admin-tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .admin-tab {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .admin-tab.active {
      color: var(--teal-dark);
      background: var(--teal-soft);
      border-color: #99f6e4;
    }

    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .tool-field {
      min-width: 126px;
      height: 34px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    th,
    td {
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 12px 10px;
      vertical-align: middle;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .table-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .sub-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .hint {
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #1e3a8a;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .decision-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .decision-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .decision-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .check-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .check-list div {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--teal);
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      margin-top: 7px;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1180px) {
      .hero,
      .model-grid,
      .decision-grid,
      .sub-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .phone-board,
      .phone-board.ops {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      }

      .flow {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .flow-node:nth-child(2n)::after {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .page {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .hero-side,
      .phone-board,
      .phone-board.ops,
      .flow,
      .money-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .section-head,
      .admin-head {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .desktop-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .side {
        display: none;
      }

      table {
        min-width: 860px;
      }

      .table-card {
        overflow-x: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="panel hero-main">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">AIcanTARA / 产品原型视觉稿</div>
          <h1>开单运营方案 1.0</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">用一套清晰的三端原型，把医生劳务费、区域运营激励、后台配置和结算追溯串成可评审的闭环。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="tag teal">医生端 H5</span>
          <span class="tag blue">运营端 H5</span>
          <span class="tag">青藤平台后台</span>
          <span class="tag amber">V0.1 推进讨论稿</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel hero-side">
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div>
            <div class="metric-label">医生劳务费</div>
            <div class="metric-value">¥360</div>
          </div>
          <p class="metric-note">按临床报告咨询任务确认，形成可追溯劳务记录。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div>
            <div class="metric-label">区域订单</div>
            <div class="metric-value">128</div>
          </div>
          <p class="metric-note">运营激励按区域业绩归属，不直接表达医生绑定收益。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div>
            <div class="metric-label">待确认咨询</div>
            <div class="metric-value">3 单</div>
          </div>
          <p class="metric-note">医生确认或按后台规则自动确认，保留任务状态。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div>
            <div class="metric-label">规则版本</div>
            <div class="metric-value">R202604</div>
          </div>
          <p class="metric-note">历史结算沿用历史版本，避免规则调整后不可解释。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">关系模型</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">区域归属用于结算，服务关系用于过程管理</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-desc">医生激励和运营激励在表达口径上分离：医生拿的是临床报告咨询劳务费，运营看的是负责区域订单业绩。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-grid">
        <div class="logic-card">
          <h3>归属优先级</h3>
          <div class="logic-list">
            <div class="logic-item">
              <div class="number">1</div>
              <div><strong>后台人工指定服务区域</strong><span>用于覆盖特殊机构、跨区服务和历史迁移。</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="logic-item">
              <div class="number">2</div>
              <div><strong>开单机构所属区域</strong><span>优先匹配医生实际业务发生地。</span></div>
            </div>
